From a76ccef62c787ee7611ad91a4dc42de4f68ef802 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Braumann <ripetitor@proton.me>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 11:27:02 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: rk3566: add ELTAY RM66 target

Add a dedicated RM66 defconfig and a single generic U-Boot control DT.

Keep only the SD, eMMC, UART and optional module SPI NOR nodes needed by
the early boot path. Linux carrier hardware remains in external DTBs
selected by Armbian.

Signed-off-by: Sergey Braumann <ripetitor@proton.me>
---
 arch/arm/dts/rk3566-eltay-rm66-u-boot.dtsi    | 10 ++
 arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rk3568/Kconfig         |  8 ++
 board/elron/eltay-rm66-rk3566/Kconfig         | 12 +++
 board/elron/eltay-rm66-rk3566/MAINTAINERS     |  7 ++
 configs/eltay-rm66-rk3566_defconfig           | 94 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../src/arm64/rockchip/rk3566-eltay-rm66.dts  | 64 +++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 195 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm/dts/rk3566-eltay-rm66-u-boot.dtsi
 create mode 100644 board/elron/eltay-rm66-rk3566/Kconfig
 create mode 100644 board/elron/eltay-rm66-rk3566/MAINTAINERS
 create mode 100644 configs/eltay-rm66-rk3566_defconfig
 create mode 100644 dts/upstream/src/arm64/rockchip/rk3566-eltay-rm66.dts

